## Solution design

The system architecture combines an Arduino MKR WiFi 1010 sensor device with a web server. Development followed Rapid Application Development (RAD), with iterative prototyping and continuous user feedback.

TODO(content): architecture diagram (IN-05).

## Build

A full-stack information system (HTML/CSS/JavaScript, PHP, MySQL) with a role-based dashboard, historical data logs, alert notifications and data visualization for temperature and humidity.

